    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d178-a1">

                <pb facs="0887" n="782" sameAs="frus:frus1958-60v03mSupp/pg782"/>


                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian">undated</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d178-3" n="3" type="facsimile" xml:id="d178-3"/>
                <p>1. Do we now have the necessary conventional capabilities for meeting limited war
                    requirements?</p>
                <p>(State, Army, Navy say “No”)</p>
                <p>2. Will the use of nuclear weapons be based solely on military criteria; that is
                    to say, are there situations where political considerations could override
                    military desirability?</p>
                <p>(Defense seems to say “Yes” to the first, “No” to the second)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
